[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1406","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1406.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0623","title":"O'Reilly WebSite Professional 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"O'Reilly WebSite Professional Web 服务器 2.4 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送超长 GET 请求或 Referrer 头部触发缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，可完全控制受影响系统。由于该 Web 服务器常用于托管商业网站，攻击者可借此植入后门、窃取数据或发起进一步攻击。目前厂商已停止维护该产品，建议用户迁移至其他受支持的 Web 服务器软件。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0623"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:07Z","remediation":"O'Reilly WebSite Professional 已停止维护，官方未发布安全补丁。建议立即迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache HTTP Server、Nginx 或 IIS）。临时缓解措施：在反向代理或防火墙层限制 HTTP 请求行和 Referer 头长度不超过 1024 字节，并部署 WAF 规则拦截超长请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ntbugtraq.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind0007&L=ntbugtraq&F=&S=&P=5946","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1492","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0623.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0623","https://github.com/sullo/nikto/blob/999670cb6a939b6c93840ce666941756e4c5dcf5/program/databases/db_server_msgs","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2000/CVE-2000-0623/README.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0623.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0623.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xxfm-q6cq-gcwc/GHSA-xxfm-q6cq-gcwc.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0623.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e